<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado have livestreamed an attack that killed a woman and a blogger and later released captured fishermen as hostages. The insurgents also struck the Maconde region, expanding the geographic scope of violence. Qatar and Mozambique held political consultations on the crisis while Russia noted updated bilateral relations with Mozambique. Alarm has risen over synthetic drug manufacturing linked to Kenya, Nigeria and Mozambique. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/fake-news-in-africa-in-an-age-of-disinformation-who-decides-what-s-true/a-79874039?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNdHR0YW95MTlmNzRPWWpnWHNFN0NHWGpVcFN5cTk3ZmZmMHNoZHZUaW9WdGd4YXlOSU5ZSDRMR0lMNXQ1cnZ5VGV2MmRpdld2eVpQVE0zenllZG9kaTVqVnlRRnozOGFWRXRaRUNjYVFmZHdFZDV0Sm9ZYmhqTEdSZF92cTBmeWRoTTRSdWFqQkt0TnpoSlJ6THNGUnpoSkFMeGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Orinoco Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trendsnafrica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPSzFYQ2ZUc0o5cnliZXo4dUlwalNrbHBVZ3FlVWdCUUUxS0N2WnJ6TmktUjEtYXA0TUJoZGZSeGt0ZF9aRm80SjBhc1U0djBGU2pEZXZ4emNLcDBxOElrSmt5Nzl6Nk9kMTZMTUh3MlRsZUdLcDZRd0tUQU9idFFwYVFPN1FwNWRpVTJ2YUFsaDVyYlMzLWpKbVBFSFR2WGRFQnRfMDRqZUpGRkVzUWM2LTV3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMil